<% content_for :title, "New chat" %>

<% content_for :page_header do %>New Chat<% end %>

<div class="grid w-full grid-cols-1 items-start gap-4 md:grid-cols-2">
  <div class="card p-6">
    <h5 class="mb-1 font-semibold">NAT Assistant</h5>
    <p class="mb-4 text-xs text-zinc-500 dark:text-zinc-400">Network Administration Tool</p>

    <p class="mb-3 text-sm font-medium">I can help you manage your Mainline inventory:</p>

    <ul class="list-disc space-y-1 ps-5 text-sm text-zinc-500 dark:text-zinc-400">
      <li>Search IP addresses</li>
      <li>Look up subnets by name or VLAN</li>
      <li>Find free (unused) IPs in a subnet</li>
      <li>Search devices by name or MAC</li>
      <li>Look up employees and their devices</li>
      <li>Search branches, departments, and locations</li>
      <li>View network stats and health</li>
      <li>See recent network activity</li>
      <li>Get device counts by type</li>
      <li>Assign IPs to devices</li>
      <li>Create new devices</li>
      <li>Read handwritten IP records from photos</li>
      <li>Import device lists from CSV or Excel files</li>
      <li>Identify rogue devices</li>
    </ul>
  </div>

  <div class="card p-6">
    <%= render "form", chat: @chat %>
  </div>
</div>
